cli.merge.lock_busy:
Another `se3 merge` is in progress (lock held by pid={holder_pid}).
Lock file: {lock_file}

Wait for the in-progress merge to finish before retrying.

cli.merge.lock_stale:
Merge lock appears stale {pid_msg}.
Lock file: {lock_file}

Remove the stale lock file and retry:
  rm {lock_file}
